  "ruleValidation": {
    "notes": [
      "只在有 IPv6 数据面的消费端适用；没有数据面的消费端仍按 peer-egress-rules-v1.json 报 EGRESS_RULE_IPV6_UNSUPPORTED。",
      "推出地址的前缀是 Peer Mesh 网段：与它重叠的 IPv6 规则报 EGRESS_RULE_MESH_OVERLAP，与 IPv4 规则覆盖 mesh 网段相同。",
      "出口能力只对在线的出口判：不在线时规则仍生效，流量计 egress-unavailable；在线而目录没有 ipv6PacketCapable，报 EGRESS_RULE_EGRESS_NO_IPV6，流量计 egress-no-ipv6。",
      "检查顺序沿用 peer-egress.md「规则语义」的编号，mesh 重叠先于出口能力。"
    ],
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "public-prefix-to-capable-egress",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": true,
        "code": null,
        "rule": {
          "match": "2001:db8:1::/48",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "the-mesh-prefix",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": true,
        "code": "EGRESS_RULE_MESH_OVERLAP",
        "rule": {
          "match": "fd53:7065:6375:7300::/96",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "one-mesh-address",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": true,
        "code": "EGRESS_RULE_MESH_OVERLAP",
        "rule": {
          "match": "fd53:7065:6375:7300::6460:2",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "a-prefix-covering-the-mesh",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": true,
        "code": "EGRESS_RULE_MESH_OVERLAP",
        "rule": {
          "match": "fd00::/8",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "next-to-the-mesh",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": true,
        "code": null,
        "rule": {
          "match": "fd53:7065:6375:7301::/64",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "online-egress-without-ipv6-packets",
        "egressOnline": true,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": false,
        "code": "EGRESS_RULE_EGRESS_NO_IPV6",
        "rule": {
          "match": "2001:db8:1::/48",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "offline-egress",
        "egressOnline": false,
        "egressIpv6PacketCapable": false,
        "code": null,
        "rule": {
          "match": "2001:db8:1::/48",
          "action": "egress",
          "egressClientId": 2
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "frames": {
    "notes": [
      "带 IPv6 数据面的解析器：type=1 的 body 按首字节高 4 位分流，4 走 peer-egress-frame-v1.json 的 IPv4 规则，6 按本节。",
      "没有数据面、或没有声明 ipv6PacketCapable 的出口仍按 peer-egress-frame-v1.json 的 ipv6-packet-in-v1 报 EGRESS_IPV6_UNSUPPORTED。",
      "解析顺序：body 短于 40 字节 → EGRESS_FRAME_TRUNCATED；40 + payloadLength 大于 body → EGRESS_FRAME_TRUNCATED，小于 → EGRESS_FRAME_TRAILING_BYTES。版本既不是 4 也不是 6 沿用一期的 EGRESS_IPV6_UNSUPPORTED。",
      "next header 不在解析时判：解析只取它与（TCP、UDP 时）端口；出口按协议处理时，TCP、UDP 以外（含任何扩展头、分片头、ICMPv6）以 EGRESS_PROTOCOL_DENIED 拒绝，与 IPv4 的 ICMP 相同。"
    ],
