  "consumerOutbound": {
    "consumerMeshIpv4": "100.96.0.1",
    "notes": [
      "消费端从 TUN 读到的 IPv6 包，在规则匹配之前按本节分流。forward 之后照常匹配规则，与 IPv4 相同。",
      "drop-silently 不计数：链路本地源与组播目的是系统自己的邻居发现与组播报告，不是流量。",
      "其余丢弃计进 blocked，原因名如 expect 所示，不回应应用。",
      "effectiveMtu 是对端会话的有效 MTU（peer-mesh.md SPMTU2）；TUN 的 MTU 为 1280，peerMeshMtu 低于 1280 的设备没有 IPv6 数据面。"
    ],
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "to-a-rule",
        "packetHex": "6000000000140640fd53706563757300000000006460000120010db80001000000000000000000c8d43101bb00000001000000005002ffff02e30000",
        "effectiveMtu": 1280,
        "expect": "forward"
      },
      {
        "name": "router-solicitation",
        "packetHex": "6000000000083a40fe800000000000000000000000000001ff0200000000000000000000000000028500000000000000",
        "effectiveMtu": 1280,
        "expect": "drop-silently",
        "note": "Link-local source: the system's own neighbour discovery on the TUN, not traffic. Not counted."
      },
      {
        "name": "multicast-listener-report",
        "packetHex": "6000000000080040fd537065637573000000000064600001ff0200000000000000000000000000163a00050200000100",
        "effectiveMtu": 1280,
        "expect": "drop-silently",
        "note": "Multicast destination: never routed into the TUN by a rule. Not counted."
      },
      {
        "name": "source-is-not-this-device",
        "packetHex": "600000000014064020010db800ff0000000000000000000120010db80001000000000000000000c8d43101bb00000001000000005002ffff7cba0000",
        "effectiveMtu": 1280,
        "expect": "ipv6-source-not-mesh",
        "note": "An application bound to another address; the egress would refuse it, so it is not sent."
      },
      {
        "name": "to-another-mesh-device",
        "packetHex": "6000000000140640fd537065637573000000000064600001fd537065637573000000000064600002d431001600000001000000005002ffff8a780000",
        "effectiveMtu": 1280,
        "expect": "ipv6-mesh-unsupported",
        "note": "Mesh traffic between devices stays IPv4; no route sends this prefix into the TUN, so this is only stray traffic."
      },
      {
        "name": "path-below-the-ipv6-minimum",
        "packetHex": "6000000000140640fd53706563757300000000006460000120010db80001000000000000000000c8d43101bb00000001000000005002ffff02e30000",
        "effectiveMtu": 1200,
        "expect": "ipv6-path-mtu",
        "note": "IPv6 needs 1280 on every link; a peer path that probes lower cannot carry it, and a Packet Too Big below 1280 means nothing to an IPv6 stack."
      }
    ]
  },
  "returnPath": {
    "consumerMeshIpv4": "100.96.0.1",
    "notes": [
      "出口 → 消费端的 IPv6 包：目的必须是本机推出地址，否则不归消费端（同时是出口的设备交给出口一侧处理），与 IPv4 相同。",
      "源在推出地址的前缀内拒收，计 return-mesh-source；找不到本机发起的存活流拒收，计 return-no-flow。",
      "liveFlow 表示本机对这个五元组、这个出口有存活流。"
    ],
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "reply-to-a-live-flow",
        "packetHex": "600000000014064020010db80001000000000000000000c8fd53706563757300000000006460000101bbd43100001b58000000025012ffffe7790000",
        "liveFlow": true,
        "expect": "deliver"
      },
      {
        "name": "reply-with-no-flow",
        "packetHex": "600000000014064020010db80001000000000000000000c8fd53706563757300000000006460000101bbd43100001b58000000025012ffffe7790000",
        "liveFlow": false,
        "expect": "return-no-flow"
      },
      {
        "name": "reply-from-a-mesh-address",
        "packetHex": "6000000000140640fd537065637573000000000064600002fd53706563757300000000006460000101bbd43100001b58000000025012ffff6d6a0000",
        "liveFlow": true,
        "expect": "return-mesh-source"
      },
      {
        "name": "addressed-to-another-device",
        "packetHex": "600000000014064020010db80001000000000000000000c8fd53706563757300000000006460000201bbd43100001b58000000025012ffffe7780000",
        "liveFlow": true,
        "expect": "not-for-consumer"
      }
    ]
  },
  "failure": {
    "notes": [
      "与 peer-egress-failure-v1.json 同一时机写回 TUN：出口不可用（离线、尚未在线、流被清掉）时，消费端拒绝转发的段与数据报。",
      "TCP 复位按 RFC 793，与 IPv4 同一条规则；IPv6 头：traffic class 0、flow label 0、hop limit 64；TCP 窗口 0，无选项。",
      "UDP 回 ICMPv6 目的不可达、地址不可达（类型 1 代码 3，对应 IPv4 的主机不可达），从原包的目的发回原包的源，引用原包直到整个错误报文不超过 1280 字节。",
      "resetOnPurge 的规则与 IPv4 相同，只换地址族，不另列用例。"
    ],
